<title>CROATIA: Croatia Nov '96 real wages index 111 vs Oct 108.8.</title>
<headline>Croatia Nov '96 real wages index 111 vs Oct 108.8.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Croatian State Statistics Bureau issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA NET WAGES		 NOV '96    OCT '96    NOV '95</p>
<p> Real wage index (base 1995)    111.0	108.8	103.0</p>
<p> Nominal wages (HRK)		2,124	2,071	1,895</p>
<p> -Goods, services sector	  2,108	2,056	1,848</p>
<p> -Public sector		     2,170	2,114	2,026</p>
<p>-- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
